      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know u arent a doctor but i'm just panicking a bit and it's like 11pm right now. i dont want to drag him to the ER if it's just a virus or something. do u think it's possible it's just a normal viral rash? it looks kinda like the stuff he gets after he's had a cold. can you tell me if there's any way i can tell if it's serious from home?",
